    "description": "Predation rates on dummies imitating caterpillars made from plasticine. Dummy caterpillars were deployed in 126 plots in the lowlands of Sumatra in 4 land use systems (forest, shrublands, rubber plantations, oil palm plantations). Dummies were exposed for 48 h in subplots B,C,D,E. Predation and predator identity were assessed via unique bitemarks in the plasticine.",
